## Lógica de animação (dentro do useEffect)

Usar `useRef` para estado mutável da animação — **não** usar `useState` para variáveis do loop (performance).

### Detecção de tema

```ts
const isDark = () => window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches
```

Chamar `getColors()` a cada frame para responder a mudanças de tema em tempo real.

### Paleta de cores (getColors)

| Token        | Light mode                    | Dark mode                     |
|--------------|-------------------------------|-------------------------------|
| `ring`       | `rgba(0,0,0,0.13)`            | `rgba(255,255,255,0.18)`      |
| `ringDim`    | `rgba(0,0,0,0.05)`            | `rgba(255,255,255,0.07)`      |
| `tick`       | `rgba(0,0,0,0.28)`            | `rgba(255,255,255,0.35)`      |
| `needle`     | `rgba(0,0,0,0.85)`            | `rgba(255,255,255,0.9)`       |
| `jewel`      | `#7f77dd` (purple-400)        | `#a89fff`                     |
| `jewel2`     | `#1d9e75` (teal-400)          | `#5dcaa5`                     |
| `jewel3`     | `#d85a30` (coral-400)         | `#f0997b`                     |
| `orbit`      | `rgba(0,0,0,0.07)`            | `rgba(255,255,255,0.10)`      |
| `planet`     | `rgba(0,0,0,0.40)`            | `rgba(255,255,255,0.55)`      |
| `dust`       | `rgba(80,70,120,{opacity})`   | `rgba(255,255,255,{opacity})` |
| `center`     | `#534ab7` (purple-600)        | `#c8c4ff`                     |

